	"FriendlyName": "Tarinoi",
	"Description": "Tarinoi dialogue for Unreal Engine. Syncs authored dialogue from the Tarinoi service into a local SQLite database, evaluates authored conditions and functions against your game's bindings, and drives dialogue playback through Blueprint-assignable events.",
